      "utf8": "at these companies. And that's also ignoring the \nstock coming from this year's slate of mega IPOs.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106880,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a lot of stock hitting a market on top of a \npotent combination of reduced buybacks, increased  "
